WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:04.984
Ringo bit his lip.

2
00:00:04.985 --> 00:00:08.345
The clamor birds didn't want to go home.

3
00:00:08.346 --> 00:00:12.395
"We get good food here," a bird said.

4
00:00:12.396 --> 00:00:15.883
Ringo tapped his chin.

5
00:00:15.884 --> 00:00:21.964
"Do you remember boomberries?" he asked.

6
00:00:21.965 --> 00:00:25.023
The birds flapped their wings.

7
00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:30.398
"I forgot about boomberries!" one bird said.

8
00:00:30.399 --> 00:00:34.394
"We love them!" the other said.

9
00:00:34.395 --> 00:00:40.952
Ringo smiled. "Boomberries only grow on Volcano Planet."

10
00:00:40.953 --> 00:00:47.002
Whoopa-tweet! Whoopa-tweet!

11
00:00:47.003 --> 00:01:08.804
"Let's go!" the birds cried.

12
00:01:08.805 --> 00:01:15.202
Ringo and Bot landed on Volcano Planet.

13
00:01:15.203 --> 00:01:27.263
The clamor birds ran to a boomberry tree.

14
00:01:27.264 --> 00:01:30.157
They picked lots of berries. Then

15
00:01:30.158 --> 00:01:33.559
they ran back to Ringo. "These

16
00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:39.052
are for you," one bird said. "No,

17
00:01:39.053 --> 00:01:42.301
thank you," Ringo said quickly. The

18
00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:45.862
birds looked angry. "We'll

19
00:01:45.863 --> 00:01:51.208
take them," Bot said. "Thank you!" The

20
00:01:51.209 --> 00:01:54.065
birds left. "Let's

21
00:01:54.066 --> 00:01:57.368
go home, Bot," Ringo said. "Yes,"

22
00:01:57.369 --> 00:02:01.347
she said. "You

23
00:02:01.348 --> 00:02:05.220
have to write your planet report." Suddenly—

24
00:02:05.221 --> 00:02:11.493
beep! Beep!

25
00:02:11.494 --> 00:02:13.819
Captain Nova was calling.

26
00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:18.176
"Ringo, Lucy needs your help.

27
00:02:18.177 --> 00:02:21.496
She has a mission on Sandstorm Planet.

28
00:02:21.497 --> 00:02:25.176
A whale turtle is in trouble."

29
00:02:25.177 --> 00:02:28.205
"No problem," Ringo said.

30
00:02:28.206 --> 00:02:43.914
"We're on our way."

